#### 代码

```Python
class Solution:
    def resultArray(self, nums: List[int]) -> List[int]:
        arr1, arr2 = [nums[0]], [nums[1]]
        for i in range(2, len(nums)):
            if arr1[-1] > arr2[-1]:
                arr1.append(nums[i])
            else:
                arr2.append(nums[i])
