#### 代码

```Python
class Solution:
    def validStrings(self, n: int) -> List[str]:
        ans = []
        mask = (1 << n) - 1
        for i in range(1 << n):
            x = mask ^ i
            if (x >> 1) & x == 0:
                ans.append(f"{i:0{n}b}")
        return ans

```

